			"notes": "## New\n\n- Forge mod for Minecraft 26.3 and 1.20.1. It only has to be installed on the server, players don't need it, and it also works in singleplayer\n- Paper is now listed as a supported platform\n- PlaceholderAPI placeholders like %tabtps_tps%, %tabtps_mspt% and %tabtps_uptime%, on Folia per region. Only active when PlaceholderAPI is installed\n- Custom text for the tab list, action bar and boss bar with MiniMessage, e.g. \"Server runs at <tps> TPS\"\n- New modules: uptime, mob_caps and mob_cap_<category> (mob caps are not available on Folia)\n- /tabtps mobcaps lists the mob caps of every world\n- /tabtps toggle <display> <player> to toggle displays for other players, /execute as ... run tabtps toggle works too\n- More color levels for themes and the boss bar\n- Optional delay before the boss bar appears after joining\n- Operators get a short chat message on join when an update is available, the update check only reports versions for your platform and Minecraft version\n- /memory shows the numbers in the console, console colors can be turned off\n\nAll new options are off by default, except the update message for operators. You can turn it off with update-notify-on-join=false in main.conf.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- No more errors when a player TabTPS never tracked leaves, e.g. fake players or failed logins\n- Players who are already online when the plugin loads get their displays\n- The boss bar follows /tick rate\n- TabTPS no longer keeps the game open when quitting singleplayer\n\n## Tested on\n\n- Folia 1.20.1, 1.20.2, 1.20.4, 1.20.6, 1.21.4, 1.21.5, 1.21.6, 1.21.8, 1.21.11, 26.1.2, 26.2, 26.3\n- Canvas 26.3\n- Paper 1.20.1, 26.3\n- Purpur 1.20.1, 1.21.4, 1.21.10, 26.3\n- Leaf 1.21.4, 26.3\n- Spigot 1.20.1, 1.21.1, 1.21.4, 26.3\n- Forge 26.3 and 1.20.1, dedicated server and singleplayer\n\n## Downloads\n\n- Plugin: `tabtps-folia-1.3.0.jar`\n- Forge 26.3: `tabtps-forge-mc26.3-1.3.0.jar`\n- Forge 1.20.1: `tabtps-forge-mc1.20.1-1.3.0.jar`\n\nBased on [TabTPS](https://github.com/jpenilla/TabTPS) by jpenilla (MIT)."
		},
