			"notes": "## Changes\n\n- Added support for Minecraft 26.2 and 26.3\n- Works on Purpur, Leaf, Spigot and Canvas now, not only Folia\n- Still runs on everything from 1.20 up, needs Java 17 or newer\n- Folia and Canvas show TPS/MSPT per region. Purpur, Leaf and Spigot only have one global tick loop, so you get server-wide values there and the region modules show N/A\n- /tickinfo now shows separate 5s, 1m, 5m and 15m values per region (before it showed the same number four times)\n- Region data is read straight from Folia's tick reports, which is more accurate and cheaper on servers with lots of regions\n- bStats is back, you can turn it off in plugins/bStats/config.yml\n- New logo\n- Updated adventure, cloud and bStats\n\n## Tested on\n\n- Folia 1.20.1, 1.20.2, 1.20.4, 1.20.6, 1.21.4, 1.21.5, 1.21.6, 1.21.8, 1.21.11, 26.1.2, 26.2, 26.3\n- Canvas 26.3\n- Purpur 1.20.1, 1.21.4, 1.21.10, 26.3\n- Leaf 1.21.4, 26.3\n- Spigot 1.20.1, 1.21.1, 1.21.4, 26.3\n\n## Installation\n\nDrop `tabtps-folia-1.2.0.jar` into your server's `plugins/` folder and restart.\n\nBased on [TabTPS](https://github.com/jpenilla/TabTPS) by jpenilla (MIT)."
		},
